  "content_html": "<div class=\"product-description j-product-description\" itemprop=\"description\">\n<div class=\"text\">\n<h2><strong>Be Trendy Rich Vibes Collection Bath Pearls - gentle care and delight in every bath</strong></h2>\n<p>Transform an ordinary bathing routine into a true beauty and relaxation ritual with Rich Vibes Collection Bath Pearls. Thanks to a blend of skin-care ingredients and pleasant sensations during bathing, this product helps create a soothing at-home SPA atmosphere and brings extra comfort to your skin.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"600\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://betrendy.space/content/uploads/images/bath-pearls-03.jpg\" width=\"600\"/></p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"600\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://betrendy.space/content/uploads/images/bath-pearls-02.jpg\" width=\"600\"/></p>\n<h2>What are bath pearls?</h2>\n<p>Bath pearls are small, aromatic granules that dissolve quickly in warm water, infusing it with beneficial ingredients. They help make bathing more enjoyable, promote relaxation, and create a special atmosphere of rest.<br/>\r\nAs they dissolve, the bath pearls evenly release active ingredients into the water, ensuring gentle skin care and creating a pleasant sensory experience.</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"600\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://betrendy.space/content/uploads/images/bath-pearls-01.jpg\" width=\"600\"/></p>\n<h2>Hemp oil for skin nourishment and comfort</h2>\n<p>The main nourishing ingredient of Rich Vibes Collection Bath Pearls is hemp oil. It is known for its high content of omega-3 and omega-6 fatty acids, which help maintain the skin's natural balance and protect it from drying out.<br/>\r\nHemp oil helps soften the skin, maintain its smoothness and elasticity, and provides a feeling of comfort after bathing. Thanks to its properties, it is well-suited for regular body care.</p>\n<h2> </h2>\n<h2>Benefits of Be Trendy Rich Vibes Collection Bath Pearls:</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Contains valuable hemp oil</li>\n<li>Helps soften and nourish the skin</li>\n<li>Creates a pleasant atmosphere of relaxation</li>\n<li>Dissolves quickly in water</li>\n<li>Makes the bath more comfortable and enjoyable</li>\n<li>Suitable for regular at-home body care</li>\n<li>Helps turn bathing into a SPA procedure</li>\n<li>Perfect choice for relaxation after an active day.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><br/>\r\nA warm bath <strong>with Rich Vibes Collection Bath Pearls</strong> helps relax after work, sports, or a busy day. The bathing ritual aids in recovery and sets a special mood for rest. The pleasant texture and nourishing properties of the product allow you to enjoy every minute of bathing.</p>\n<h2> </h2>\n<h2>Directions for Use</h2>\n<p>Add the required amount of bath pearls to a warm bath and wait until the granules are completely dissolved. Take a bath for 15–20 minutes, enjoying the atmosphere of comfort and relaxation.</p>\n<p> </p>\n<h2>Rich Vibes Collection — more than just skincare</h2>\n<p>Be Trendy Rich Vibes Collection Bath Pearls are a delightful blend of sensory pleasure, nourishing ingredients, and gentle skin care. This product helps you create your own at-home SPA ritual, bringing moments of harmony, relaxation, and pure bliss to every bath.</p>\n </div>\n</div>",
